ggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ideogram4_fp8_scaled.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.8.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [253, 281], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["{\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"high_level_description\":\"An epic, highly complex wide-angle shot of a massive futuristic gathering in a colossal underground cavern, featuring tens of thousands of people forming a sea of lights, a gigantic central holographic monolith, and dramatic atmospheric lighting.\",\"compositional_deconstruction\":{\"background\":\"A colossal, dark, brutalist underground cavern with towering, curved concrete walls disappearing into the shadows above. The floor is a vast, dark, reflective obsidian surface. Filling the entire lower two-thirds of the background is a dense, unenumerable crowd of tens of thousands of people. They are not individually distinct but form a massive, swirling ocean of tiny, glowing pale blue lights (#ADD8E6) held in their hands, creating a breathtaking, starry-night effect on the ground. The atmosphere is filled with a low-lying, soft blue mist.\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"obj\",\"bbox\":[200,100,800,600],\"desc\":\"A gigantic, floating, geometric monolith in the center-top of the frame. It is a complex, multifaceted crystal structure, glowing with a warm, pulsing golden light (#FFD700). It casts massive, dramatic god-rays downwards, illuminating the mist and the sea of people below. The scale is immense, dwarfing the entire crowd.\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"bbox\":[50,50,950,150],\"text\":\"UNITY // PROTOCOL 2026\",\"desc\":\"Massive, bold, sans-serif typography in bright white (#FFFFFF), floating high above the monolith, spanning almost the entire width of the top of the frame. The text has a subtle holographic glitch effect.\"},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"bbox\":[850,700,950,800],\"desc\":\"A tiny, highly detailed drone in the extreme foreground bottom-right, slightly out of focus, observing the massive scene, providing a sense of scale and perspective.\"}]}}"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 264, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 315, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [430, 420], "pos": [4925.64892578125, 1364.8687744140625], "id": 186, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.8.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 39}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [273.3465270996094, 85.21482849121094], "color": "#232", "pos": [3888, 1511.6754150390625], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 233, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "提示词扩写", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [268, 288], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [269, 290], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["3:4 (Portrait Standard)", 1, 8], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "megapixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "multiple"}, "name": "multiple", "label": "multiple", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "multiple"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ResolutionSelector", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [380, 170], "pos": [3883.5087890625, 2002.156005859375], "id": 37, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.23.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "ResolutionSelector", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["\nThis is a prompt construction template. You can copy its input into any LLM to generate matching prompts.\n\n---\nYou may try installing or updating [KJNodes](https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes) and use the **Ideogram 4 Prompt Builder KJ** node to achieve visual control over prompts."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [520, 360], "pos": [6210.8359375, 2352.7578125], "id": 176, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [287], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [430, 520], "pos": [4359.22705078125, 458.1990661621094], "widgets_values": ["WORKFLOW COVER POSTER DESIGN — 768x1024 vertical, 1K quality\nStyle: Cyber-Pop / Tech-Anime, inspired by Ideogram 4 poster layout\nColor scheme: bg=暖白渐变背景 #FDF6F0->#F5E6D3, 柔和光晕; primary=#E88D8D 暖粉色; secondary=#3D2C2C 深棕色; accent=#FF6B6B 珊瑚色\n\n--- ELEMENTS (positioned from top-left 0,0 to bottom-right 768,1024) ---\n\n[TITLE-1] type=text pos=[50,20,718,100]\n  content=\"高清服装证件照\" — dual-color: \"高清服装\"=primary(#E88D8D 暖粉色) + \"证件照\"=secondary(#3D2C2C 深棕色)\n  style=extrabold Chinese, largest font, double stroke(white outline+color shadow), smooth no cracks, slight tilt(-5deg)+curve\n\n[TITLE-2] type=text pos=[50,105,718,150]\n  content=\"证件照\" — dual-color: primary+secondary\n  style=Chinese bold, smaller than TITLE-1, double stroke, smooth\n\n[DIVIDER] type=line pos=[150,155,618,157]\n  thin glowing line, accent color #FF6B6B 珊瑚色, slight glow\n\n[TITLE-3] type=text pos=[50,162,718,210]\n  content=\"F.2Klein9B\" — \"F.2Klein9B\"=secondary(#3D2C2C 深棕色) + \"\"=primary(#E88D8D 暖粉色)\n  style=brush-stroke bold, double stroke, rough textured edges, slight cracks, brush paint texture\n\n[TAG] type=badge pos=[620,30,740,60]\n  content=\"工作流\" white text, 暖粉色 #E88D8D 和香槟金 #C9A96E style background, rounded pill shape\n\n[DECORATION] type=sparkles pos=scattered\n  4-point yellow stars around title area, abstract splash/brush stroke textures, dynamic energy\n\n[COMPARISON] type=image pos=[30,260,400,750] ratio=3:4\n  half-body portrait(bust-up) left-right comparison — left side: 左半为日常自拍/生活照（自然光，休闲服装，非正式）; right side: 右半为标准证件照（红蓝白纯色底，正装衬衫，面部端正，耳朵露出，正式证件照构图）\n  vertical divider line in center, same person before/after, focus on transformation\n\n[CHARACTER] type=anime_girl pos=[420,360,700,750] size=50% of COMPARISON\n  动漫风格角色(Anime/Manga Cel-shaded), 半身照构图(胸部以上), 大眼有神, 精致发丝渲染, 现代时尚/街头服饰, 单眼wink微笑手指指向标题方向, 姿态自信动人\n  clothes printed with \"F.2Klein9B\" logo, pointing at COMPARISON area, simple background behind\n\n[BOTTOM-BG] type=brush_stroke pos=[0,790,768,1024]\n  abstract paint brush stroke/splash as background, sweeping diagonally from bottom, irregular edges, dynamic tilt\n  on top of brush stroke: large white bold \"F.2Klein9B!\" slightly tilted, below it smaller \"让创意，精准落地!\" slightly tilted, text with soft glow\n\n[LOGO] type=logo pos=[660,880,740,990]\n  minimal line-art brain logo(white line, circuit pattern), below it \"F.2Klein9B\" in small white thin font\n\n[DECORATION2] type=sparkles pos=[bottom_area]\n  scattered star/sparkle dots around brush stroke area, matching the splash texture\n\n[RULE] No outer frame, no border glow lines. The character is the focal point."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 204, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "System Prompt", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.23.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 11}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-2561.159600735557, -1012.708870555943], "scale": 0.7247295000000007}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Models", "bounding": [4349.576171875, 1321.2960205078125, 530, 1100]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "Latent Size", "bounding": [4909.576171875, 1981.2960205078125, 450, 440]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "Sampling", "bounding": [5389.576171875, 1321.2960205078125, 780, 1100]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "Prompt", "bounding": [4909.576171875, 1321.2960205078125, 450, 640]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "Image Size", "bounding": [3779.576171875, 2441.2958984375, 530, 420]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 9, "title": "Preset", "bounding": [4359.47412109375, 2434.22802734375, 1820, 780]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 10, "title": "提示词扩写", "bounding": [4349.22705078125, 384.5989685058594, 3923.83642578125, 900.780029296875]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 11, "title": "提示词", "bounding": [3879.956298828125, 1640.0557861328125, 432.901123046875, 313.9562072753906]}], "links": [[253, 186, 